  # Ballistic Weapons Specifications
  Notes:
  - For munitions that accelerate over time (such as missiles), range is a rough estimate.
  - For munitions that are fired at a static speed (such as normal weapons), range is simply just the launch velocity * projectile lifetime.
  - RPS may not be accurate due to it being capped by server tick speed (usually 20 or 30 ticks/second).
  - All ballistic weapons have unlimited standard ammo. Many of them can be loaded with special, limited ammunition either by hand or using an autoloader system.

